@startuml
!include ../../themes/activity-theme.puml

title E-commerce — order processing activity

|COLOR_LANE_PURPLE|customer| **Customer**\n<size:11><color:COLOR_TEXT_MUTED>web / mobile</color></size>
|COLOR_LANE_BLUE|order| **Order Service**\n<size:11><color:COLOR_TEXT_MUTED>order lifecycle</color></size>
|COLOR_LANE_GREEN|inventory| **Inventory Service**\n<size:11><color:COLOR_TEXT_MUTED>stock reservation</color></size>
|COLOR_LANE_RED|payment| **Payment Service**\n<size:11><color:COLOR_TEXT_MUTED>payment authorization</color></size>
|COLOR_LANE_YELLOW|bus| **Event Bus**\n<size:11><color:COLOR_TEXT_MUTED>asynchronous events</color></size>
|COLOR_LANE_GRAY|notification| **Notification**\n<size:11><color:COLOR_TEXT_MUTED>customer messages</color></size>

|customer|
start
:Add products to cart; <<primary>>
:Submit checkout; <<primary>>

|order|
:Create order\n**PENDING_STOCK**; <<primary>>
:Order has an immutable\nprice snapshot.; <<rule>>

|inventory|
:Reserve stock; <<primary>>

if (Stock available?) then (yes)
    :Create reservation; <<secondary>>

    |order|
    :Move order to\n**PENDING_PAYMENT**; <<primary>>

    |payment|
    :Authorize payment; <<primary>>

    if (Payment authorized?) then (yes)
        :Store authorization id; <<secondary>>

        |order|
        :Confirm order\n**CONFIRMED**; <<important>>

        |bus|
        :Publish **OrderConfirmed**; <<optional>>

        -[COLOR_ARROW_ASYNC,dashed]->
        |notification|
        :Send order confirmation; <<optional>>

        |customer|
        :See confirmed order; <<success>>
        stop

    else (no)
        :Return rejection reason; <<failure>>

        |inventory|
        :Release stock reservation; <<secondary>>

        |order|
        :Mark order\n**PAYMENT_FAILED**; <<failure>>

        |customer|
        :Choose another payment method; <<secondary>>
        stop
    endif

else (no)
    |order|
    :Reject order\n**OUT_OF_STOCK**; <<failure>>

    |customer|
    :Show unavailable items; <<secondary>>
    stop
endif

legend bottom right
  **Activities**
  Filled blue = primary action
  White = secondary action
  Dashed border = optional / side effect
  Dashed transparent = rule / constraint
  Yellow = important business point
  Green / red = success / failure

  **Arrows**
  Solid = synchronous flow
  Dashed = async / event
endlegend

@enduml
